<p><strong>ABOUT THE YARN:</strong> <br />DROPS Muskat is a colourful yarn, made from 100% Egyptian mercerized cotton, the finest long cotton fiber you can lay your hands on! Spun from multiple thin strands, which make it extremely strong and durable, this yarn has a gentle shine and great shape stability.</p>

