<ul>
<li>machine wash on wool cycle 30°C</li>
</ul>
', '100% Merino', 'https://images4-g.ravelrycache.com/uploads/DebbieBliss/416984589/Debbie-Bliss-Rialto-DK-Yarn_small_best_fit.jpg', '{}'::jsonb, '2026-02-26T16:33:21.957886+00:00', '2026-02-26T16:33:21.957886+00:00'),
  (4208, 'Cashmerino DK', 'debbie-bliss-cashmerino-dk', 'Debbie Bliss', 2, 11, 'DK', '8', '22', NULL, '11', 50, 120, NULL, NULL, 'plied   ', 4, 22, NULL, '6 ', NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, true, 4.44, 2194, 9741, '
<p>Labels used to say 33% microfiber (which is just a superfine synthetic fiber) and now say 33% acrylic.</p>
', '12% Cashmere, 33% Acrylic, 55% Merino', 'https://images4-f.ravelrycache.com/uploads/DebbieBliss/1041393520/8b7f08e6-9d4b-40e2-a84e-6a9b18f3b6d4_small_best_fit.jpg', '{}'::jsonb, '2026-02-26T16:33:18.18232+00:00', '2026-02-26T16:33:18.18232+00:00'),
  (5006, 'Silky Merino', 'malabrigo-yarn-silky-merino', 'Malabrigo Yarn', 95, 11, 'DK', '8', '22', NULL, '11', 50, 150, NULL, NULL, 'Single', 4, 22, 24, '4 ', '6 ', 3.5, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, NULL, 4.66, 6481, 30174, '
<p>This delightfully drapey favorite combines 50% silk and 50% merino into a single-ply DK yarn that is absolutely a treat to knit and a joy to wear. The combination is soft, smooth, and itch-free even on the most sensitive skin- absolutely wonderful for garments, scarves, and other next-to-your-skin items. The silk content gives the yarn a bit more weight and drape than a pure merino, and a slight sheen that is absolutely gorgeous. The fibers take dye a little differently, adding extra depth to the wide selection of semi-solid, variegated, and watercolor-multi colorways available.</p>

<p><strong>Great for:</strong> Accessories, shawls, garments, cables, colorwork, textured stitches, lace.</p>

<p>Be sure to get enough yarn to complete your project since each bag is a different dye lot, and skeins may vary from bag to bag. In the tagged (*) colors, the skeins may vary one from the other even within the same bag. To ensure random color distribution, work from two balls of yarn at once, alternating a few rows from each ball.</p>
', '49% Merino, 51% Silk', 'https://images4-g.ravelrycache.com/uploads/LorenWeiss/675011499/upload_small_best_fit', '{}'::jsonb, '2026-02-26T16:27:20.698539+00:00', '2026-02-26T16:27:20.698539+00:00'),
  (5723, 'Snuggly Baby Bamboo Double Knitting', 'sirdar-snuggly-baby-bamboo-double-knitting', 'Sirdar', 14, 11, 'DK', '8', '22', NULL, '11', 50, 105, NULL, NULL, 'plied', 4, 22, NULL, '6 ', NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, true, 4.27, 3110, 13277, '
<p><strong>Fiber Type:</strong> <br />80% Bamboo, 20% Wool</p>

<p><strong>Care Instructions: <br />
</strong>Machine wash, do not tumble dry or iron, may be dry cleaned.</p>
', '20% Wool, 80% Bamboo', 'https://images4-f.ravelrycache.com/uploads/jjs9292/297628138/IMG_1933_small_best_fit.JPG', '{}'::jsonb, '2026-02-26T16:32:56.451814+00:00', '2026-02-26T16:32:56.451814+00:00'),
  (7687, 'Special Double Knit', 'stylecraft-special-double-knit', 'Stylecraft', 1035, 11, 'DK', '8', '22', NULL, '11', 100, 322, NULL, NULL, 'plied ', 4, 22, NULL, '3 ', '6 ', 3.25, 4, '3 ', '6 ', 3.25, 4, false, true, 4.56, 5896, 26874, '
<p>Stylecraft Special DK knitting yarn is the very best in economical cheap knitting yarns. With its new and improved quality, cleaner look and softer handle, there really is no better option.</p>

<p>100% premium acrylic in 100 g balls. Also sold in 50 gram skeins with 161 yards. This is the same base yarn, so please adjust yardage and skein size on individual stash pages.</p>

<p>Tension is 22 stitches and 30 rows for a 10 x 10 cm tension square using 4 mm needles.</p>

<p>Yarn may be dry cleaned.</p>
