<p>From LionBrand.com: “A novelty ‘eyelash’ yarn, Fun Fur is the go-to yarn for that luxurious fur-look. Use it for entire projects from fashion accessories to home accessories, or use it to trim your projects and combine it with other yarns. Fun Fur comes in solids, stripes, and NEW exotics, which feature two different lengths of fur for even more texture.”</p>

<p>Note: Ball bands from yarn made in Italy say there are 64 yards in a 50 g skein while those made in Turkey say there are 60 yards in a 50 g skein. The same colorway can be made in either country and be different lengths per skein.</p>

<p>Article # 320</p>

<p>Care Instructions (as per Lion Brand): <br />Machine wash, Warm max temperature 40°C or 104°F, Do not bleach, Do not iron. Dry clean any solvent. Tumble dry normal (For colors: 125, 149 and 150 Lay flat to dry)</p>
', '100% Polyester', 'https://images4-g.ravelrycache.com/uploads/squeakyweasels/522867528/650279584_e0d221ab30_b_small.jpg', '{}'::jsonb, '2026-02-28T18:03:44.445025+00:00', '2026-02-28T18:03:44.445025+00:00'),
  (1913, 'Homespun', 'lion-brand-homespun', 'Lion Brand', 99, 4, 'Bulky', '12', '14-15', NULL, '7', 170, 185, NULL, NULL, 'Single ply wrapped with binder, flammé', 4, 10, 14, '10 ', '10 ', 6, 6, '10.5', NULL, 6.5, NULL, false, true, 3.38, 9174, 30991, '
<p>From shawls to sweaters to throws, this yarn can’t be beat for softness and sheer touch-ability. With solids, heathers, and beautiful self-striping ‘painterly’ colors, <strong>Homespun®</strong> comes in gorgeous shades you’ll love. Please note that some colors have long, slow color variations that cause them to subtly stripe. This is deliberate and adds to the beauty of the finished garment; such yarns are designated as our ‘painterly’ colors.</p>

<p><a href="https://www.lionbrand.com/collections/all-knit-crochet-patterns?uff_293oob_tags=Homespun%20-%20790#/filter:tags_yarn_used:Homespun$2520-$2520790"><strong>Free patterns made with Homespun®</strong></a> <br /><a href="https://www.lionbrand.com/collections/all-knit-crochet-kits?uff_293oob_tags=Homespun%20-%20790"><strong>Kits made with Homespun®</strong></a></p>

<p>Yarn Weight: 5 Bulky <br />Gauge over 4in x 4in: <br />Crochet: 10 sc x 10 r on K-10.5 (6.5mm) <br />Knit: 14 sts x 20 r on #10 (6mm)</p>

<p>Length: 185 yards/169m <br />Weight: 6 oz./170g</p>

<p>Fiber: 98% Acrylic, 2% Polyester <br />Care: Machine Wash, Machine Dry</p>

<p>Care Detail: Machine wash. Initial water temperature should not exceed 40C or 105F. No bleach product may be used. A machine dryer may be regularly used at the hottest available temperature setting. Item may not be smoothed or finished with an iron.</p>
