<p><em>LionBrand.com info:</em> Moonlight Mohair is a bulky weight yarn that mixes a strand of soft mohair with a slubbed, sparkly, multi-colored yarn. The sophisticated colors and exciting textures will make any project extra-special.</p>

<p>Gauge: <br />Knit: 12 stitches x 18 rows = 4” (10 cm) on size 10.5 (6.5mm) needles <br />Crochet: 9 sc x 11 rows = 4” (10 cm) with K-10 (6.5mm) hook</p>

<p>Product Care Instructions: Items made from this yarn may be laundered through the use of water, detergent or soap and gentle hand manipulation. Any dry cleaning solvent other than trichloroethylene may be safely used. No bleach product may be used. A machine dryer may not be used.</p>

