<p>96% Wool, 4% Other fibers.</p>

<p><strong>Crochet</strong> Hook P-15 10mm. 5 sc 6 rows/4 inches.</p>
', '4% Other, 96% Wool', 'https://images4-f.ravelrycache.com/flickr/2/2/2/2222750551/2222750551_m.jpg', '{}'::jsonb, '2026-03-01T02:17:35.384635+00:00', '2026-03-01T02:17:35.384635+00:00'),
  (18789, 'Handspun Merino Jumbo', 'snowberry--lime-handspun-merino-jumbo', 'Snowberry & Lime', 3808, 16, 'Jumbo', NULL, '0-6', NULL, '0-4', 99, 58, NULL, NULL, 'plied, handspun', NULL, NULL, NULL, '15 ', '50 ', 10, 25, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, true, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '
<p>This is definitely one of my very favourite yarns! Handspun from hand dyed merino.. As all my yarns this is definitely next to skin soft and the dyes used are up to a professional standard. <br />Throughout the whole yarn are very detailed little bee buttons spun in. It is a 2ply yarn and to convey the look of bee hives, there are lots of coils as well.</p>

<p>To top it all off there is a separate needle felted bumble bee which can be sewn on to the finished item. You can see this little bee on the third picture.</p>

<p>In my mind this is going to be a wild and fluffy hat, striped with a simpler solid colored yarn to achieve a beehive look. I would love to see what you make of this!</p>

<p>Merino, buttons, 53m/58 yards, 99g/3.5oz</p>

<p>Handspun in an entirely smoke and pet free home.</p>
', '100% Merino', 'https://images4-f.ravelrycache.com/uploads/Snowberrylime/522956836/1407768973_4a49569f09_b_small.jpg', '{}'::jsonb, '2026-03-01T02:28:51.005217+00:00', '2026-03-01T02:28:51.005217+00:00'),
